WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.133
Get the file, plus the record of another AI checking it

00:00:03.133 --> 00:00:07.067
Write the request once, in plain words

00:00:07.067 --> 00:00:10.233
Attach the source; split making from checking

00:00:10.233 --> 00:00:13.133
Send. From here it runs on your computer

00:00:13.133 --> 00:00:18.133
One writes it, another checks it and sends it back — sped up: three versions, 14m36s, local model

00:00:18.133 --> 00:00:26.067
The checks pass on r3. You choose the version — cost $0.00, run on local Ollama

00:00:26.067 --> 00:00:29.067
uvx --from "git+https://github.com/FORIFOR/Multibot#subdirectory=backend" agentteam quickstart
